| `/processModels/list/sub` | GET | 获取子流程列表 |
| `/processParams/{systemId}` | GET | 获取设备信号树 |
| `/processParams/generalData` | GET | 获取设备类型 |
| `/processParams/staticLogicSignal` | GET | 获取逻辑信号 |
| `/processHistories` | GET | 分页流程历史 |
| `/processHistories/{id}` | GET | 任务详情 |
| `/processInstances/{id}/{status}` | PATCH | 强制终止 |
| `/processInstances/process/{key}` | POST | 触发规则 |
| `/processVariables/pages` | GET | 分页查询变量 |
| `/processVariables` | GET/POST | 变量列表 / 创建 |
| `/processVariables/{id}` | DELETE/PUT | 删除/修改变量 |
| `/processVariables/instances/pages` | GET | 变量实例列表 |

